Package: GARMAPR
Type: Package
Title: Access and Retrieve Water Quality Data from GARMAP
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Eugin", "Bornman",
           email = "euginbornman@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Eugin Bornman [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Eugin Bornman <euginbornman@gmail.com>
Description: Provides functions to authenticate with the Gulf of America
    Regional Monitoring and Assessment Program (GARMAP) database and
    retrieve water quality observations from monitoring stations.
    Supports retrieval of temperature, salinity, and dissolved oxygen
    data across individual or multiple monitoring stations.
